OL,3,GNEWSAWoman caught fly-tipping in car
OL,4,Apark fined and has vehicle seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman convicted of fly-tipping has
OL,7,Fhad her car removed and been ordered to
OL,8,Fpay more than #3,000, a council has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FEileen McDonagh, 37, of Thirlmere Place
OL,12,Fin St Julians, Newport, was spotted
OL,13,Fdumping household waste in the
OL,14,FPillgwenlly area of the city.
OL,16,FNewport Council said she drove off
OL,17,Fafter being approached by members of
OL,18,Fits environmental protection and
OL,19,Fcommunity safety enforcement teams.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
