OL,3,GNEWSAWoman caught fly-tipping in car
OL,4,Apark fined and has vehicle seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing an investigation, the council
OL,7,Fseized the vehicle she had used to dump
OL,8,Fher rubbish and prosecuted McDonagh for
OL,9,Ffly-tipping and offences relating to
OL,10,Fduty of care over household waste.
